# pydocvi: model=gpt-5-6-mini prompt=574466d7 glossary=1 batch=10da7e8a3566 run=2026-08-17T16:43Z
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note that in Python, unlike C, assignment inside expressions must be done "
"explicitly with the :ref:`walrus operator <why-can-t-i-use-an-assignment-in-"
"an-expression>` ``:=``. This avoids a common class of problems encountered in"
